// Example: GPU kernel for matrix multiplication
//
// Demonstrates multiple kernel functions in a single file.
// The gpu-emit command will extract all kernels and emit PTX for each.
//
// Usage:
//   souc check examples/kernel_matmul.sio
//   souc run self-hosted/ -- gpu-emit examples/kernel_matmul.sio
//   souc run self-hosted/ -- gpu-emit --autotune examples/kernel_matmul.sio
//   souc run self-hosted/ -- gpu-emit --target=metal examples/kernel_matmul.sio

